    AuthoritativeEnemySession enemyCombat
    EnemySnapshotHistory enemyServerSnapshots
    EnemySnapshotHistory enemyClientSnapshots
    EnemyImpactSnapshotHistory enemyServerImpactSnapshots
    EnemyImpactSnapshotHistory enemyClientImpactSnapshots
    ImpactPresentationQueue impactPresentations
    ImpactPresentationHistory feedbackHistory
